      "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:46:26.005Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I tried both frappe cloud and self hosted via docker i found there is difference in erpnext version.</p>\n<p>Frappe cloud Erpnext comes with India_Compliance runn smoothly without any error.</p>\n<p>Frappe cloud Erpnext using ERPNext v15.89.0  (HEAD) when we installed ERPNext via docker I got Erpnext:v15.90.1 and doesn’t comes with india_Compliance. When i install india_Compliance in gst setting I got error message in gst setting i also get same error<br>\nInvalid “depends_on” expression</p>\n<p>Frappe Erpnext is claiming it is free and open source but reality is they try to push user to use frappe cloud paid version. Where every thing is running smoothly.</p>",
